  "description": "The agent reads each vendor bill from email, matches it to the purchase order, and flags a price difference before anyone pays. A person approves it, and it lands in the client's accounting software, ready to post. lumic keeps it running for a monthly fee. A managed AP agent went live about six weeks after the on-site day, and 64 of 67 bills went through it in week one."},
